{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": " εἰς or ἐς, PREP. WITH ACC. ONLY:—both forms are found in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hom.", "author_abbreviation": "Hom.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", Ion. poets, and early metrical Inscrr.; ἐς is best attested in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt.", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " and "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hp.", "author_abbreviation": "Hp.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", and is found in nearly all early Ion. Inscrr. (exc. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "IG 12(8).262.16", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (Thasos, v B. C.), ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "7.235.1", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (Oropus, iv B. C.)); εἰς in Att. Inscrr. from iv B. C., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "IG 2.115", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; and usu. in Att. Prose (exc. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th.", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ") and Com. (exc. in parody): Trag. apptly. prefer εἰς, but ἐς is used before vowels metri gr.; ἐς was retained in the phrases ἐς κόρακας (whence the Verb σκορακίζω), ἐς μακαρίαν. Aeol. poets have εἰς before vowels, ἐς before consonants, and this is given as the rule in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hom.", "author_abbreviation": "Hom.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " by "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "An.Ox. 1.172", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hellad.", "author_abbreviation": "Hellad.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " ap. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Phot. Bibl. p.533B.", "author_abbreviation": "Phot.", "tlg_author": "4040", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (Orig. ἐνς, as in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "IG 4.554.7", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (Argos), "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "GDI 4986.11", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (Crete); cf. ἐν, ἰν. The diphthong is genuine in εἰς, but spurious in - Att. Ion. ) Radical sense into, and then more loosely, to: OF PLACE, the oldest and commonest usage, εἰς ἅλα into or to the sea, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 1.141", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", al.; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰς ἅλαδε Od. 10.351", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἔς ῥ' ἀσαμίνθους 4.48", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐς οἶνον βάλε φάρμακον ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "220", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; freq. of places, to, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰς Εὔβοιαν 3.174", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐς Αἴγυπτον, etc., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 1.5", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; ἐς Μίλητον into the territory of Miletus, ib."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "14", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰς Ἑλλήσποντον εἰσέπλει X. HG 1.1.2", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀφίκετο εἰς Μήδους πρὸς Κυαξάρην Id. Cyr. 2.1.2", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; εἰς ἅρματα βαίνειν to step into . . , "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 8.115", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰς ἐλάτην ἀναβῆναι 14.287", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; opp. ἐκ, in such phrases as ἐς σφυρὸν ἐκ πτέρνης, ἐς πόδας ἐκ κεφαλῆς, from heel to ankle-joint, from head to foot, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "22.397", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "23.169", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐκ πάτου ἐς σκοπιήν 20.137", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐς μυχὸν ἐξ οὐδοῦ Od. 7.87", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; κἠς ἔτος ἐξ ἔτεος from year to year, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Theoc. 18.15", "author_abbreviation": "Theoc.", "tlg_author": "0005", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": with Verbs implying motion or direction, as of looking, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἰδεῖν εἰς οὐρανόν Il. 3.364", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; εἰς ὦπα ἰδέσθαι to look in the face, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "9.373", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; εἰς ὦπα ἔοικεν he is like in face (sc. ἰδόντι), "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "3.158", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; ἐς ὀφθαλμούς τινος ἐλθεῖν to come before another's eyes, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "24.204", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐς ὄψιν ἀπικνέεσθαί τινος Hdt. 1.136", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "καλέσαι τινὰ ἐς ὄψιν Id. 5.106", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; ἐς ταὐτὸν ἥκειν come to the same point, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "E. Hipp. 273", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "005", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": less freq. after a Subst., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ὁδὸς ἐς λαύρην Od. 22.128", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; τὸ ἐς Παλλήνην τεῖχος facing Pallene, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 1.56", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ξύνοδος ἐς τὴν Δῆλον Id. 3.104", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf."}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Tht. 173d", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". Ep. and Ion. , also c. acc. pers. ( ὡς, πρός, παρά), "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 7.312", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Att."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "15.402", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Att."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 14.127", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": ["Att."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 4.147", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Att."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; also in Att. with collective Nouns, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐς τὸν δῆμον παρελθόντες Th. 5.45", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Att."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", or plurals, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰς ὑμᾶς εἰσῆλθον D. 18.103", "author_abbreviation": "D.", "tlg_author": "0014", "tlg_work": "018", "dialects": ["Att."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; esp. of consulting an oracle, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐς θεὸν ἐλθεῖν Pi. O. 7.31", "author_abbreviation": "Pi.", "tlg_author": "0033", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Att."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰς Ἄμμων' ἐλθόντες Ar. Av. 619", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": ["Att."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". with Verbs expressing rest in a place, when a previous motion into or to it is implied, ἐς μέγαρον κατέθηκεν ἐπὶ θρόνου he put it in the house (i.e. he brought it into the house, and put it there), "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 20.96", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐς θρόνους ἕζοντο they sat them down upon the seats, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "4.51", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1.130", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐφάνη λὶς εἰς ὁδόν the lion appeared in the path, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 15.276", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀπόστολος ἐς τὴν Μίλητον ἦν Hdt. 1.21", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (s. v.l.); "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αὐτὸς ἐς Αακεδαίμονα ἀπόστολος ἐγίνετο Id. 5.38", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐς κώμην παραγίνονται Id. 1.185", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "παρῆν ἐς Σάρδις Id. 6.1", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐς δόμους μένειν S. Aj. 80", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "003", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " (cod. Laur.); "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐς τὴν νῆσον κατέκλῃσε Th. 1.109", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 3.13", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἀπόβασιν ποιήσασθαι ἐς . . "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Th. 2.33", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; later used like ἐν, τὴν γῆν εἰς ἣν ὑμεῖς κατοικεῖτε "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "LXX Nu. 35.34", "author_abbreviation": "LXX", "tlg_author": "0527", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τὸ χρυσίον ὃ εἰλήφεσαν εἰς Ῥώμην D.S. 14.117", "author_abbreviation": "D.S.", "tlg_author": "0060", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "οἰκεῖν εἰς τὰ Ὕπατα Luc. Asin. 1", "author_abbreviation": "Luc.", "tlg_author": "0061", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰς Ἐκβάτανα ἀποθανεῖν Ael. VH 7.8", "author_abbreviation": "Ael.", "tlg_author": "0545", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰς ἅπασαν τὴν γῆν Suid.", "author_abbreviation": "Suid.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " s.v. Καλλίμαχος : generally, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "τοὔνομα εἰς τὴν Ἑλλάδα, φασίν, Ἱππομιγὴς δύναται Ael. VH 9.16", "author_abbreviation": "Ael.", "tlg_author": "0545", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". with Verbs of saying or speaking, εἰς relates to the persons to or before whom one speaks, εἰπεῖν ἐς πάντας, ἐς πάντας αὔδα, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hdt. 8.26", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "S. OT 93", "author_abbreviation": "S.", "tlg_author": "0011", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "λέγειν εἰς τὸ μέσον τῶν ταξιάρχων X. Cyr. 3.3.7", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "αἱ ἐς τὸ φανερὸν λεγόμεναι αἰτίαι Th. 1.23", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ": with other Verbs, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰς τοὺς Ἕλληνας σαυτὸν σοφιστὴν παρέχων Pl. Prt. 312a", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "022", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "καλὸν ἐς τοὺς Ἕλληνας τὸ ἀγώνισμα φανεῖσθαι Th. 7.56", "author_abbreviation": "Th.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐπαχθὴς <*>ν ἐς τοὺς τολλούς "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. 6.54", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "στρατιὰν ἐπαγγέλλων ἐς τοὺς ξυμμάχους Id. 7.17", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0003", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "διαβεβλῆσθαι εἴς τινα Pl. R. 539c", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". elliptical usages, after Verbs which have no sense of motion to or into a place, τὴν πόλιν ἐξέλιπον εἰς χωρίον ὀχυρόν they quitted the city for a strong position, i.e. to seek a strong position, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "X. An. 1.2.24", "author_abbreviation": "X.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "006", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; γράμματα ἑάλωσαν εἰς Ἀθήνας letters were captured [and sent] to Athens, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Id. HG 1.1.23", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0032", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. R. 468a", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "030", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀνίστασθαι ἐς Ἄργος E. Heracl. 59", "author_abbreviation": "E.", "tlg_author": "0006", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Pl. Phd. 116a", "author_abbreviation": "Pl.", "tlg_author": "0059", "tlg_work": "004", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ". participles signifying motion are freq. omitted with εἰς, τοῖς στρατηγοῖς τοῖς εἰς Σικελίαν (sc. ἀποδειχθεῖσιν) "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "And. 1.11", "author_abbreviation": "And.", "tlg_author": "0027", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc. c. gen., mostly of proper names, as εἰς Ἀΐδαο, εἰς Ἅιδου [δόμους], "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Il. 21.48", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Att."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐς Ἀθηναίης [ἱερόν] to the temple of Athena, "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "6.379", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Att."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; ἐς Πριάμοιο [οἶκον] "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "24.160", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Att."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", cf. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "309", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Att."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; εἰς Αἰγύπτοιο [ῥόον] "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Od. 4.581", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": ["Att."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐς τοῦ Κλεομένεος Hdt. 5.51", "author_abbreviation": "Hdt.", "tlg_author": "0016", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": ["Att."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "εἰς Ἀσκληπιοῦ Ar. Pl. 411", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "011", "dialects": ["Att."]}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἐπὶ δεῖπνον [ἰέναι